%% F041: Badge Hover Tooltip 互動時序
%% 描述使用者 hover Badge 後 Tooltip 顯示/隱藏的完整互動邏輯

sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Badge as NodeFieldBadge
    participant Timer as Hover Timer
    participant Manager as Tooltip Manager<br/>(Context/Store)
    participant Portal as BadgeTooltipPortal
    participant Content as buildTooltipContent()
    participant Position as useTooltipPosition()

    Note over Admin,Portal: Hover 觸發流程
    Admin->>Badge: mouseenter
    Badge->>Timer: 啟動 300ms 計時器
    Timer-->>Timer: 等待 300ms

    alt 300ms 內移出
        Admin->>Badge: mouseleave
        Badge->>Timer: 取消計時器
    else 300ms 到達
        Timer->>Manager: requestShow(nodeId)
        Manager->>Manager: 關閉其他 Tooltip
        Manager->>Content: 計算 Tooltip 內容(nodeData)
        Content-->>Manager: BadgeTooltipContent
        Manager->>Position: 計算定位(badgeRect)
        Position-->>Manager: {x, y, placement}
        Manager->>Portal: 渲染 Tooltip
        Portal-->>Admin: 顯示 Tooltip
    end

    Note over Admin,Portal: 離開 Badge → 進入 Tooltip
    Admin->>Badge: mouseleave
    Badge->>Timer: 啟動 200ms 隱藏計時器

    alt 200ms 內進入 Tooltip
        Admin->>Portal: mouseenter
        Portal->>Timer: 取消隱藏計時器
        Note over Admin,Portal: Tooltip 保持顯示
    else 200ms 到達
        Timer->>Manager: requestHide(nodeId)
        Manager->>Portal: 卸載 Tooltip
    end

    Note over Admin,Portal: 離開 Tooltip
    Admin->>Portal: mouseleave
    Portal->>Timer: 啟動 200ms 隱藏計時器

    alt 200ms 內回到 Badge 或 Tooltip
        Timer->>Timer: 取消計時器
    else 200ms 到達
        Timer->>Manager: requestHide(nodeId)
        Manager->>Portal: 卸載 Tooltip
    end

    Note over Admin,Portal: 點擊查看完整
    Admin->>Portal: click "點擊查看完整"
    Portal->>Manager: requestHide(nodeId)
    Portal->>Badge: selectNode(nodeId)
    Badge->>Badge: 開啟屬性面板 → 欄位流分頁
